cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EPR-Bench, please cite it as below."
title: "EPR-Bench: a deterministic synthetic UK electronic patient record for benchmarking LLM agents"
abstract: >-
  A self-contained, deterministic, UK-style electronic patient record with fictional patients, reachable through tool
  calls, a JSON API and a web UI, with tasks graded by deterministic checks over the final record. Preview release:
  the clinical content is a draft and has not been clinically validated.
